│ There was an effect of group×assessment period, indicating that the experimental (B=7.26, P=0.061, d=0.44,           │
│ statistically imprecise) and pseudo-experimental group (B=11.19, P=0.003, d=0.76) increased more in reported         │
│ empowerment compared to the control group. In the pseudo-experimental group, 29% of the participants showed a        │
