│ early identification of treatment and problem-solving strategies in routine practice", "abstract": "Client-focused   │
│ research systems have been developed to monitor and provide feedback information about clients\' progress in         │
│ psychotherapy as a method of enhancing outcome for those who are predicted to be treatment failures. In the current  │
│ study, the authors examined whether feedback regarding client progress and the use of clinical support tools (CSTs)  │
